# Single-page app fallback.
#
# React Router owns every path (/decide, /near-me, /restaurant/:id, …), but those
# files do not exist on disk. Without this rule a visitor who opens a deep link
# or refreshes any page other than "/" gets a 404 from the CDN.
#
# The 200 status makes it a rewrite, not a redirect, so the URL the user sees is
# preserved and the router can read it.
/*    /index.html   200
